# E90 caustic stress suite: scalability check. Eight glass objects of
# varied roughness (0.0 / 0.03 / 0.08 / 0.15 / 0.30 plus one dispersive
# and one prism) stand on a low table under the small ceiling panel, each
# casting its own caustic. Pushes photon-count, lookup radius and chain
# classification cost up together - a coarse performance/robustness canary
# for the caustic cache.
# Intended film: 640x360 (the e90 harness renders it smaller).
